{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_117_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_117_fc_01_title", "source_sha256": "55347838c8862c7ada4cd28a4f522f8cb5c6b27039553e7f896d38cb6c5cf059", "ja": "ただ、その一瞬のために", "zh": "只为那一瞬", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_117_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_117_fc_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f212634930afd493f34bb097228a6c3d47bc6c1a9cbdbdda9da97c4215de32e6", "ja": "フィットネスや化粧品で自分磨き！\n輝かんばかりの魅力を湛えて\nステージの開演を待つ\nアイドルたちの一幕です。", "zh": "通过健身和化妆品提升自己！\n浑身洋溢着耀眼的魅力\n等待着舞台开演的\n偶像们的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_117_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_117_fc_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "43df5f5e4a16a79f38862fc71369dd15a8a3c609e53682098a42f9c848570847", "ja": "（今日は化粧品会社とのタイアップ公演がある。\n今後に繋げるためにも、是非成功させたいところだ！）", "zh": "（今天有和化妆品公司的合作公演。为了今后的发展，也一定要让它成功！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_117_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_117_fc_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "97e178eda8cf9ed10c8f75571f81f8aabfde3436056fa7580a61753936fd6a4a", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま！　準備はどうだ？", "zh": "大家辛苦了！准备得怎么样了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_117_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_117_fc_01_1002_003mik", "source_sha256": "a0e1d6382d4778082a00fce586c7aac3cf9675e3e7fc8221ea3db27c4146bf13", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}。お疲れさまなの～☆\nミキたちは準備オッケーってカンジ！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。辛苦啦～☆\n美希她们已经准备好啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_117_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_117_fc_01_1003_038chz", "source_sha256": "e9e8c24afe377d7281991e7b96fb6e2fe5abba549f77ade90182674f6a78d748", "ja": "あずさとのり子がまだ来てませんわ。新しい衣装で、\n着替えに手間取っているのでしょうか？", "zh": "あずさ和法子还没来呢。难道是换新服装时费了些时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_117_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_117_fc_01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "14e4d71a0d7d17ad1e49550e88d54e519f98290fdcf891a11210915e71c4aa3e", "ja": "そうですか。じゃあちょっと様子を見に……。", "zh": "这样啊。那我去看看情况……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_117_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_117_fc_01_1005_se", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_117_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_117_fc_01_1006_010azu", "source_sha256": "aaf721bde04cf43192f56c593c5008fd1459c911d6377572450639f1a8c49948", "ja": "お疲れさまです～。\nごめんなさい、遅くなってしまって……。", "zh": "辛苦了～  \n对不起，让你们久等了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_117_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_117_fc_01_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "6d9eced4925bb674acd210656ff742da9673c9aa77f70f53122384f9e73f2076", "ja": "ひゃー、待たせちゃってゴメン！\n……って、あれ？　みんな、どうかしたの？", "zh": "呀——抱歉让你久等了！……咦，怎么了？大家这是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_117_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_117_fc_01_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "f4902381073bb3ea886f382a17c3861fe3b0211538a6808d7a679e3188a68701", "ja": "アズサ、ノリコ……\nふたりとも、すっごくかわいいヨ～！！", "zh": "阿梓、纪子……\n你们两个都超级可爱哟～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_117_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_117_fc_01_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "f4bb7fd05db182ba367f19f0405e85b1d5b05195744e9f30fcfbd191d36991c6", "ja": "うん！　あずささんはスポーティーで、\nのり子さんはドレッシーな感じ！　いつもと反対だね♪", "zh": "嗯！　梓姐姐很有运动风，\n典子姐姐则是很时髦的感觉！和往常正好相反呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_117_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_117_fc_01_1010_038chz", "source_sha256": "ffe3b4da4ba1ae04b3fe51822e6ab1e61453bf0f9dc9d6f96dda5e9952d62c9a", "ja": "本当に、よく似合ってますわ。わたくしとしたことが、\nふたりのオーラに気圧されてしまいましたもの。", "zh": "真的非常合适呢。没想到连我也被两位的气场压倒了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_117_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_117_fc_01_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "a4964005ba334facd04de958251ab350217c7bd00106c9f52300ef87b6dd826e", "ja": "あははっ、ありがとっ！　そう言ってもらえて、\nすっごくうれしいよ。ね、あずささん！", "zh": "啊哈哈，谢谢你！能听你这么说，\n我真的超级开心的。对吧，梓小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_117_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_117_fc_01_1012_010azu", "source_sha256": "aeaf02c88864b0a3cd66c7a9de29cbd607f6a6da5a7de91aa441cb2cdc927e32", "ja": "ええ。それにのり子ちゃんも素敵だけど、\nみんなも素敵だわ。今日のライブ、頑張りましょうね。", "zh": "嗯。而且，虽然纪子也很棒，但大家也都很棒。今天的演出，我们一起加油吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_117_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_117_fc_01_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "7cbd6071d57beb364a8f1eef53c463e06a358a55188096018a527dd9f2679750", "ja": "ふたりとも、なんだかキラキラしてるの……\n{$P$}、何かした？", "zh": "你们两个，总觉得都在闪闪发光……\n{$P$}，你做了什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_117_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_117_fc_01_1014_p", "source_sha256": "da1d047820e50b8882f367df01810789c066bb6c8ad02309f00e354f062c9fa0", "ja": "え？　いや、特に何もしてないけど……。", "zh": "诶？没有，我也没特别做什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_117_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_117_fc_01_1015_010azu", "source_sha256": "40f5b2895239dc6c581c52faffdf0cb9006fca2bbf8ba1f5050c06b2c52ec5d0", "ja": "もしかして、アレのおかげかしら？\nね、のり子ちゃん。", "zh": "该不会是托那个的福吧？\n对吧，纪子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_117_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_117_fc_01_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "35054b8d68a3bbae4d1753f9f88e0d8876afe0722b912f59c641e9fb324fd2b7", "ja": "うん。アタシたちがキラキラしてるとしたら、\nフィットネスと、化粧品のおかげかも？", "zh": "嗯。要是说我们看起来闪闪发光的话，\n说不定是健身和化妆品的功劳？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_117_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_117_fc_01_1017_030iku", "source_sha256": "7a6ec896bf1083f33f6652d0c8f554e25a44b037ac11d51643f15d0ee37a597d", "ja": "お化粧はわかるけど……\nフィットネスって、運動でしょ？", "zh": "化妆我能理解，可是……\n健身就是运动吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_117_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_117_fc_01_1018_010azu", "source_sha256": "42609ad501593231e912d62a9159fab2db5aa43e68c4698561ae1bf149a17e00", "ja": "ええ。今回は、化粧品会社さんのお仕事だから、\nすこしでも綺麗にと思って……。", "zh": "嗯。这次是化妆品公司的工作，所以想让自己变得更漂亮一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_117_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_117_fc_01_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "0b6d1f6a7f1a80453e4def07d739419d6969940b5ddc092875b719cc2ec4c71a", "ja": "それで、ふたりでネットを見たり、\n雑誌を買ったりして、いろいろ研究したんだよね！", "zh": "所以，我们俩一起上网查资料、买杂志，做了各种研究呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_117_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_117_fc_01_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "104a0864cbb3775dbb9ba910760bc872b79e33b92dfb733e31e0b5310a6a06e3", "ja": "え～、いいナいいナ～！\nワタシも仲間に入りたかったヨ～！", "zh": "诶～真好真好～！\n我也想加入你们的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_117_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_117_fc_01_1021_010azu", "source_sha256": "356c3bc3b8412f42bf11350437b5ffe01bf22be8de9144459c8faf3b82d44cd8", "ja": "あらあら……。じゃあライブが終わったら、\nみんなで勉強会でもしましょうか？", "zh": "哎呀呀……那等演出结束之后，\n大家一起开个学习会怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_117_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_117_fc_01_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "eaef3e3049411f5fa514175282c0ab2a13eea4a480b58ebfe9ba9aa2e344ebe4", "ja": "いいね！　でもその前に、ライブ頑張らないと。\nみんな、張り切っていくよ！　おーっ！", "zh": "好主意！不过在这之前，得先全力搞好演出才行。\n大家，打起精神上吧！哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_117_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_117_fc_01_1023_003mik", "source_sha256": "0e3cef6f04042efb40460728f969fa52f83cb93cf906d25c9ef4ae1afe0f4048", "ja": "おーっ！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
